# UNREVIEWED PLACEHOLDER. No translator has reviewed these words: they
# stand in so a change of language can be seen working, and stay a
# placeholder until a translator has reviewed every one. The header says so
# too: flagged fuzzy, gettext's mark of a catalogue not yet approved, and
# its Last-Translator and Language-Team naming none. The words themselves are
# not flagged: the engine skips a fuzzy entry and would show its English,
# while it reads a fuzzy header, plural rule and all.
