# gd-chime. MIT licensed; see the LICENCE file at the root of this folder.
#
# The floor's words in French, translating the template gd-chime.pot: every
# word the floor's recipes and models show, keyed by the English it is
# written in where it is used, and how French writes its script, numbers,
# money and dates (language.gd, formats.gd). An entry under a context is
# looked up under that context alone. French says 0 as it says 1: the plural
# rule below is the one its counts are chosen by, and a count's words for
# none are an entry of their own.
#, fuzzy
